Summary of changes:
- Folder layout changed from Claude Code (.claude/) to Antigravity (GEMINI.md + SKILL.md).
- Agent-to-agent messaging (SendMessage) replaced with a hand-off section at the end
  of each output file; the main agent runs the roles in order, and may split the
  visualization and writing steps across subagents (invoke_subagent).
- Each run writes to its own folder: _workspace/<YYYYMMDD>-<topic>/.
- Web tool names changed to Antigravity's (search_web). Numbers without a source are
  no longer filled in from general knowledge.
- Calculations are checked with Python; a calculation log is kept in the analysis.
- Charts are produced as inline SVG, and a self-contained report.html is generated.
- Added a quick mode for classes, a confidentiality check on input data, and
  scripts/open_results.py to copy results to Desktop/Downloads and open the folder.

